+    does not apply to `C:\\`, which is why the ancestry check passes while
+    every directory M1 creates must still be PROTECTED."""
+    inherited = {"type": 0, "flags": m1.INHERIT_ONLY_ACE, "sid": "S-1-5-11",
+                 "mask": m1.FILE_ALL_ACCESS}
